INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-xz 4d17da43f14929f5c8b2bd51634835679f116be7cd67231bcd174492821d85d6
INSTALL /v0.1.3/demos/tools/Dollyfile-yacc 65d3f5e2aaadad784a31a6257cec109a8a231bd1b0cb313cfbb55910c0220758

REQUIRES HEADER sdl2
